    "body": "We have encountered a similar issue with reloads/navigations in [this test](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/156bb7cbb8483f6ffd4b275a1ed0b628fd0582cc/navigation-api/ordering-and-transition/transition-cross-document.html#L17), where our implementation ends up firing navigateerror because [#apply-the-history-step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#apply-the-history-step:~:text=Set%20the%20ongoing%20navigation%20for%20navigable%20to%20%22traversal%22%2E) called from [#reload](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#reloading-and-traversing:apply-the-reload-history-step) aborts the event created in [#fire-a-push/replace/reload-navigate-event](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#fire-a-push/replace/reload-navigate-event), which hasn't been cleared because #commit-a-navigate-event goes through [this path](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#inner-navigate-event-firing-algorithm:~:text=Otherwise%2C%20if%20apiMethodTracker%20is%20non%2Dnull%2C%20then%20clean%20up%20apiMethodTracker%2E).",
    "author_association": "NONE",
