    "updated_at": "2025-11-18T14:54:29Z",
    "body": "And this is really an issue for `#fire-a-traverse-navigate-event` as well. Looking at the call sequence from for example `History.back` down to where the navigate event is fired in [#checking-if-unloading-is-canceled](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#preventing-navigation:fire-a-traverse-navigate-event) nothing aborts a potentially ongoing navigation.",
